      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pamela Nel from Leonard Wilson Keenan Estate & Letting Agents are delighted to present this truly unique property to the market at Station Road, Ballyduff, Co. Waterford, P51 X2V1.\r\n\r\nOccupying a generous site in the picturesque village of Ballyduff, this exceptional property comprises two detached residences, a detached workshop, and extensive on-site parking, all situated on one site. Offering an outstanding combination of lifestyle, investment potential and flexibility, this is a rare opportunity for owner-occupiers, investors or those seeking multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nThe main residence, extending to approximately 100 sq. m., offers bright and spacious accommodation comprising four well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom, and comfortable living areas, making it an ideal family home.\r\n\r\nThe second detached residence, extending to approximately 136 sq. m., is currently operating as a successful Airbnb and presents an excellent opportunity to generate an immediate income. The accommodation comprises three spacious bedrooms, a family bathroom, and generous living accommodation throughout. A standout feature of this home is its superb outdoor entertainment area, complete with a covered lounge and a luxurious jacuzzi, providing the perfect setting for entertaining guests or relaxing in complete privacy.\r\n\r\nFurther enhancing the appeal of this exceptional property is a detached workshop, providing excellent space for storage, hobbies, a home business, or a wide variety of practical uses.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from extensive on-site parking, providing ample space for numerous vehicles and ensuring convenience for both residents and Airbnb guests.\r\n\r\nThe property has a BER rating of E, reflecting its traditional character while offering purchasers the opportunity to further enhance its energy efficiency over time.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in the heart of Ballyduff, the property enjoys the peace and charm of village life while remaining within easy reach of Fermoy, Mallow, Lismore and Tallow, with Cork City also within comfortable commuting distance. Local amenities include schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities, and the spectacular Blackwater Valley, renowned for its scenic beauty, walking trails, fishing, and outdoor pursuits.\r\n\r\nProperties Features:\r\n\r\nOffering two detached homes, an established Airbnb business, a detached workshop, extensive on-site parking, and premium outdoor entertaining facilities all on one site are exceptionally rare. Whether you are searching for a substantial family home with an additional income stream, accommodation for extended family, or an outstanding investment opportunity, this remarkable property is sure to impress.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, versatility, and unique lifestyle opportunity this exceptional property has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
